<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech stats office sees lower 97 wage growth.</title>
<headline>Czech stats office sees lower 97 wage growth.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) revised downwards on Friday its forecast for nominal wage growth in 1997 to 14.0-15.5 percent from a previous 14.5-16.5 percent.</p>
<p>The CSU revised a number of key forecasts for the economy in 1997 from its earlier predictions released in February.</p>
<p>-- Prague newsroom, +420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
